@@ -18,11 +18,13 @@ ### Added
 - Local and VPS Docker stacks with a `bin/pf` controller (`up`, `down`, `logs`, `doctor`, `deploy`, `smoke`, `shell`) and a GitHub Actions deploy-dev workflow to the VPS ([#8](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/8), [#9](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/9), [#10](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/10), [#11](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/11), [#12](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/12)).
 - CI: Pest test gate on PRs/push via `bin/pf shell` ([#21](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/21)).
 - Editor/agent LSP support: Intelephense (general PHP) and first-party Laravel LSP (routes, views/Blade, config, Livewire) wired via `opencode.json`, shared `.claude/settings.json`, and `.vscode/` workspace settings ([#25](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/25)).
+- Entity data model: `entities` and `entity_memberships` tables, `Entity`/`EntityMembership` models, the `UserRole` enum, factories, and entity/membership authorization policies. The database enforces one owner per entity through the generated `owner_seq` column and its unique index.
 
 ### Changed
 
 - Documented architecture: PegaFilaWeb is a single repository for frontend, backend and totem API; Flutter remains only as a separate client.
 - Simplified model: ticket is single-use (one call; write-once except `called_at`/`called_by`) — removed `ticket_calls` table; ticket knows only its queue (no `totem_id`). `tickets.priority` is now an integer (higher = more prioritized).
+- Replaced the circular `entities.owner_membership_id` reference with the owner role and the database-enforced `entity_memberships.owner_seq` unique index.
 - Expanded financial model: `billing_accounts` (1:0..1 with entity) + `subscriptions` + `plans` isolate financial data. New tables: `payment_options` (cycle, method, discount, refund window) and `payments` (individual charges). `billing_accounts` has `cpf_cnpj`. Subscription 1:1 with `billing_account_id` (UK); history in `payments`. Added `tickets.code`, explicit unique constraints, and circular FK note for owner. Removed per-queue user access limit.
 
 ### Fixed
